  "title": "Why Genetic Testing Matters Before Using Targeted Small Molecule Therapies in Cancer Treatment",
  "summary": "Genetic testing is essential before using targeted small molecule therapies in canine cancer treatment. It identifies tumor-specific mutations, ensuring the selection of effective, personalized therapies and improving outcomes, especially in aggressive and genetically diverse cancers.",
